{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_st01",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_st01",
  "title": "噩梦",
  "storyCode": "CF-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9bc96dd1dbbfc8a8ec69bd4236f8f9b056a939800b92112c0af723989ad37197",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，老家伙，醒醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潮湿，温暖，柔软，土壤在流动。\n沉默，轻柔，缓慢，意识在下沉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你还不能在这里倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "它会逃掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滚烫的月光浇在头颅上，身下的土壤几乎要沸腾起来，濒临破灭的意识被这股热流冲上顶端，灼痛感强迫他睁开双眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是的，就是这样，站起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我......昏迷了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "五分钟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "五分钟，我浪费了太久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "大多数时候，一秒钟就能决定一名猎人的生死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但这次幸好，你还有时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "去湖边，把你的矛捡回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "猎矛，猎人赖以存活的倚仗，如今半截淹没在湖光里。\n他忘记了自己为什么丢下了矛，就像丢下了自己的性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "矛重新立了起来，矛尖的血腥依旧新鲜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "或许你需要洗把脸清醒一下，你已经追了三天三夜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "不过三天，我还没有老到那种程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "那头野兽逃到哪里去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "受伤了，它在森林里走不远，估计现在正在某个阴冷的角落舔舐自己的伤口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "森林......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你在恐惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "胡说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你在怀疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怀疑是自己在前进，还是森林在逼近，张牙舞爪地朝你扑来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你几乎都要转身逃跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "别试图掩饰，你的一切都逃不过我的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是听着，我不会否定你的恐惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这片森林就是一头怪物，关于它的一切都值得恐惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "一头怪物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "一头噩梦般的怪物，张开它的血盆大口，将生命啃咬撕碎。这就是森林本来的样貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "是的，是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但它并非不可战胜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我问你，你还记得我最后的模样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我记得，我永远不会忘记。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你愤怒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我愤怒，我愤怒得浑身颤抖，指甲嵌进手掌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "很好，我要你愤怒，你必须愤怒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你会害怕，会慌乱，会痛苦万分，但愤怒会冲刷掉这一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "在愤怒面前不会有任何阻碍，森林会因为你的怒火而不堪一击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "没错，我会愤怒，我会拔去森林的尖牙，砍下它的利爪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "它如何对待你，我就会如何奉还。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "很好，那边有血迹，去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "啧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "还是温热的，它流的血不少，伤口又开裂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "血迹在这里之后就消失了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看到树上那些抓痕了吗？仔细观察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "用不着你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "树干被抓得很深，它一定抓了很多次，刮下了大量树皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "在痕迹的边缘残留有被血浸透的毛发，地上也有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这些畜生越来越狡猾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "它知道血会暴露踪迹，于是把木屑蹭在伤口上止血，又在原先的痕迹上抓得更深，以掩盖自己的行踪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但野兽毕竟是野兽，再细的墨棒擦过白纸也会留下痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "苍钩草的果实会附在路过野兽的皮毛上，它们总是喜欢搭顺风车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "看看那些离开的小家伙们为我们指出了通往何处的道路，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "果然，它进了那个洞穴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "什么？那种声音......我从没听过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哦，看来我们有新朋友了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "它的声音让我很兴奋，说不定会是它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "别急，猎人总是专注眼前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我知道你在里面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你的伤口很痛吧，你在流血。为什么怎样舔舐都不起作用呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "成为猎物的感觉怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你还记得那些曾被你的齿爪撕裂的生命吗？你有体会到它们的感受吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "现在你和我一样，饥肠辘辘，筋疲力尽。我们都到了最后的时刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你没有退路了，战斗是我们唯一的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "哈，我明白了，或许你需要一些刺激。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "（手掌握住锋利的矛头，血顺着手臂流淌而下）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "闻到了吗？是你喜欢的血的味道，甜美的生命滋味，你恨不得现在就上来撕咬吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "只要杀死我，这具躯体就能任你享用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你有没有这个本事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "畜生！还有这样的力气吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "该死的东西，挪开......你的臭嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如此轻易就被击倒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "瞧瞧你的样子，真是可怜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "口口声声地说着杀死野兽，面对垂死挣扎的它却毫无抵抗之力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "被压在身下撕扯，就像一块破布，和你真是一样般配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "义冈，这么多年的战斗还不够锤炼你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "不......我没有倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你是在寄希望于能和它同归于尽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我真愚蠢，竟然还期望你能做到那些事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我可以......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，你做不到，你马上就会在这里倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我......绝不会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那就举起你的矛，狠狠地去戳！去刺！去扎进它的身体！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "一下！两下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "对了，就是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你必须愤怒到豁出性命，愤怒到不顾一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "我必须愤怒到不顾一切，为了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "为了我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "去杀了它！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "没错，是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "快，站起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你必须让它恐惧你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你闭嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你！这可怖的森林的尖牙和利爪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "好像差一点点就能杀了我，你是这么觉得的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你以为我已经投降了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "来啊！我就在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "杀了我啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "猎矛从野兽的咽喉中穿出，老去的躯壳亦轰然倒地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷光倏忽炸裂，映出天穹下的庞大阴影，煌煌的火焰划破阴云。\n他浑身颤抖，指甲深深地嵌入皮肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "是它，一定是它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "从未见过的怪物......原来如此，就是它把你留在了那里啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的猎人",
      "text": "你绝不会轻易被野兽打倒，所以，一定没错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
